        "TileImage": "$($repository 662fcbaf-fe49-42ac-9703-7a5ea90b3388).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Colorado 47. This is our second to last stop before we take on Halcyon. Jackdaw is close to identifying who The Listener is. He&apos;s advised us to take out the last remaining operatives that haven&apos;t abandoned the agency. This will draw out the director of Halcyon as well as The Listener. I will brief you on your last target before we take on The Listener once you exfiltrate.\rThese people know you 47. So no point going in with a disguse.\rGood hunting 47.",
